**第 5 题**：把下面的多层嵌套用卫语句重构（不改变行为）：

<div class="md-codeblock" data-lang="python"><div class="md-codebar"><span class="md-codelang">python</span><button type="button" class="md-copy" onclick="copyBlock(this)">复制</button></div><pre><code class="language-python">def check(user):
    if user:
        if user.get(&quot;age&quot;, 0) &gt;= 18:
            return &quot;成年&quot;
        else:
            return &quot;未成年&quot;
    return &quot;无用户&quot;</code></pre></div>
